      158  ==Culture==
      159  In Rîșcani District, there are 96 [[cultural institution]]s, including 6 [[Palace of Culture|houses of culture]], 37 [[Club (organization)|clubs]], 52 [[Library|libraries]], and 1 [[museum]]. There are 160 artistic groups, 19 of which hold the title of “model ensemble.”
      160  ==Health==
      161  The district has a [[hospital]] with 250 beds, as well as a general family medicine center with 18 family doctor offices, 8 [[Community health center|health center]]s, and 20 medical points.
      162  == Personalities ==
